Note on the optional `hantek` extra
-----------------------------------

The MIT terms above cover this repository's own source code. They do not
extend to third-party dependencies.

The optional extra `lnt[hantek]` installs Hantek6022API, which is licensed
GPL-3.0-or-later. This repository contains no Hantek6022API code and does not
redistribute it; the extra is fetched from its upstream repository by the user
at install time, and the import is lazy (see `src/lnt/scope_io.py`).

Bundling that driver into a distributable binary produces a combined work
subject to the GPL. See `docs/distribution-policy.md` before building or
sharing any such artifact. A full dependency inventory with licenses lives in
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
